<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoNodeCreateBranch</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to create a new branch node</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Node.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">SilikoNode *SilikoNodeCreateBranch(const char *function_Name);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoNodeCreateBranch</function> function creates a
new branch <type>SilikoNode</type> with <varname>function_name</varname>
as the branch id value.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoNodeCreateBranch</function> returns a pointer to a
new branch <type>SilikoNode</type> object on success, or
<literal>NULL</literal> if there was a memory error.</para>
</refsection>
